# Moseo's infusion ability has an intervening "if you gained life this turn" (CR 603.4): Bot1 gained none on turn 1, so at its end
# step the ability never goes on the stack - no target is asked (`! Bot1.Target`) - and the Llanowar Elves Entomb put into the
# graveyard stays there. Bot2 gaining life is no help: nothing is gained here. The positive control is the sibling scenarios.
# Moseo's enters trigger still makes the Pest: 5 permanents (four Moxen, Moseo) and the Pest, 6.

